st uppercase mb-2 block\">Inclusive Travel AI</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-100 tracking-tight mb-4\">Explore India with Voice &amp; Text</h2><p class=\"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6\">Travlex is an AI travel companion for India, configured with real-time text chat and live audio streams. This project is built specifically to assist visually impaired or blind users with descriptive, voice-first navigation guides.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-800/40 text-emerald-300 text-xs rounded-xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-alert w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16h.01\"></path></svg><span><strong>Accessibility Tip:</strong> Switch to the <strong>Voice Guide</strong> tab for a screen-reader friendly voice conversation.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"flex bg-slate-900 p-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 self-center\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition-all bg-emerald-600 text-white shadow\" aria-label=\"Switch to Text Chatbot Mode\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg>Text Chatbot</button><button class=\"flex items-center 